    "title" : "Kutchan House 2 - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1729523213947\" id=\"item-6716687f81774c267b7e28d9\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-3512f3c262b8c9481f7f\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Charming Home in Kutchan, Niseko: A Blend of Modern Comfort and Traditional Style</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located in the serene area of Kutchan, Niseko, this delightful home is an ideal blend of modern comfort and traditional Japanese architecture. Designed thoughtfully to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, this property offers an excellent living space for both families and investors.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Property Features:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>3 Bedrooms</strong>: Each bedroom is designed to provide a peaceful and relaxing environment, featuring ample natural light and storage space.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1 Bathroom</strong>: A well-appointed bathroom with modern fittings and elegant marble tiles, providing a luxurious feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>1 Living Room</strong>: The heart of the home is a spacious living room, perfect for family gatherings, featuring traditional woodwork and large windows that flood the space with natural light.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen and Dining Area</strong>: A functional kitchen equipped with modern appliances, ample cabinetry, and a cozy dining area adjacent to the kitchen, perfect for everyday meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Aesthetic Touches</strong>: Features traditional sliding doors and wooden beams that add to the character and charm of the home.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space</strong>: The property includes a charming garden area that offers a tranquil retreat and potential space for outdoor entertaining.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This home\u2019s location in Kutchan provides easy access to local amenities, including shops, restaurants, and public transport, making it a convenient place to live or holiday. With its unique blend of style and function, this property is a wonderful opportunity to own a piece of Niseko\u2019s sought-after real estate market. Whether you\u2019re looking for a permanent residence, a holiday home, or an investment property, Kutchan House 2 offers an appealing option for a variety of needs.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;671670fcf8468e1e8e8f1c34&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;671670fcf8468e1e8e8f1c34&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1729504727952_124217\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"671c535a3d4dbe686b2ad0fa\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729909597057-VXRO10DAEC1A4NZD29WZ/Kutchan+House+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" alt=\"Kutchan House Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (2).jpg\" /></noscript><img class=\"thumb-image\" elementtiming=\"system-gallery-block-stacked\" data-src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729909597057-VXRO10DAEC1A4NZD29WZ/Kutchan+House+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" data-image=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1729909597057-VXRO10DAEC1A4NZD29WZ/Kutchan+House+Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Japan+Real+Estate+Property+Agent+Photographer+Videographer+%282%29.jpg\" data-image-dimensions=\"1600x1067\" data-image-focal-point=\"0.5,0.5\" alt=\"Kutchan House Niseko Kutchan Hokkaido Japan Real Estate Property Agent Photographer Videographer (2).jpg\" data-load=\"false\" data-image-id=\"671c535a3d4dbe686b2ad0fa\" data-type=\"image\" />\n            \n          </div>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"671c537a79f31f1b59db09cb\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \